maksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kOYY9-MGmxAQ7kNvwFEDonS&_nc_oc=AdqGvxPILs_L3EnosjFaKFru4HJYJ8fDTYBsNWnF0xNJ_BIUp2fC6p4mpV8XKq1_P3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKAHovxm71U93N45lprgRC1nVzvdj3S-L3xMboAVz-2yg&oe=6AAE8854"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQMoCMwHKUcQ7kNvwEK2EPD&_nc_oc=AdouO-NBHhVYH2h31KJh4QUkk2AYdlWLx_pR7KXKze4q6QYQyccbiCipX_yo0DywsZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQJP4sooo0NK0wn-a57vwtqy_S3hWedg9QA4dRTYtl9Q&oe=6AAE8D32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TarE-P9p4KwQ7kNvwEGX7BJ&_nc_oc=AdpQ9QXb5uxAg90nmkL9yfqbCziuEZiipApioeGOzF6-3a26TYibDgEpwM7McLXtL84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJph5kcFhkj4gAfnjlTB6xtAEhkQqqfdCHorAQY1vwLMQ&oe=6AAE9AD5"}, {"file_name":